  "content": "\n\n<p>“Iris”的非官方分支，专为与 FML 兼容而制作</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模组需要 Beddium 模组，下载链接如下：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beddium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beddium</a></p>\n<p>目前暂无 1.21.1 版本的正式更新，但此处提供了归档版本。我已联系开发者，他表示将会重新发布：<a href=\"https://github.com/peaksuperior885/Thorbedium/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/peaksuperior885/Thorbedium/releases</a></p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fforgeoculus\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://api.tomas65107.dev/cdn/platformdecals/modrinth.png\" width=\"220\">\n  </a>\n\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/peaksuperior885/ForgeOculus\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://api.tomas65107.dev/cdn/platformdecals/github.png\" width=\"220\">\n  </a>\n\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Uuxy92JNF3\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://api.tomas65107.dev/cdn/platformdecals/discord.png\" width=\"220\">\n  </a>\n</p>",
